      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHOPPER SURE CAN (1) settled back off the inside but went through his gears strongly to find the frame with a 2.75 lengths third (19.99) at this track in Grade 6. Likely to be in the finish again. TECHNO MISSILE (5) produced a moderate performance last time when seventh at Q Lakeside over 457m behind In The Jungle (26.38) in a Grade 6. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Has ability and is one of the better chances. JAKARI BUDGIE (7) was safely held last time out, finishing eighth at this track over 366m behind Frog's Rock (20.41) in a Grade 6. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. TROOPER SURE CAN (4) has ability and looks a top-three prospect.",
